### Install the "REST Client" extension in VS Code, then click "Send Request" above each block.
@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### Create a product
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "RGB, hot-swappable switches",
  "priceInCents": 549900,
  "category": "electronics",
  "stock": 25
}

### List products (pagination, filter, sort)
GET {{base}}/products?page=1&limit=10&category=electronics&sort=-priceInCents

### Price range
GET {{base}}/products?minPrice=10000&maxPrice=600000

### Text search
GET {{base}}/products?search=keyboard

### Get one (paste an _id from the create response)
GET {{base}}/products/PASTE_ID_HERE

### Partial update
PATCH {{base}}/products/PASTE_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stock": 20 }

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/products/PASTE_ID_HERE

### Validation error example
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "x", "priceInCents": -5, "category": "toys" }
